// Fulton County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the qPublic property
// search and the Board of Elections) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Sanitary Engineer is now the Department of Public Utilities.
//   * Wauseon and Archbold schools moved to Google Sites; Community Hospitals and
//     Wellness Centers' Archbold site is now Parkview Archbold Medical Center.
//   * The Fulton County Expositor and Swanton Enterprise merged into the Northwest
//     Signal (Napoleon) in 2023; the Archbold Buckeye ended in 2025.
//   * The economic development site is thriveinfultoncounty.com (fcedc-ohio.com
//     redirects there); the visitors bureau is visitfultoncounty.com.
//   * fultoncountyhs.org (old historical society domain) is now a spam blog; the
//     society runs museumoffultoncounty.org.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Fulton County GA (Atlanta), NY, PA, IL, IN (incl. its community foundation),
//   KY, AR; Swanton VT; villageofmetamora.com is Metamora, Illinois; archbold.org
//   is a Georgia hospital. The VILLAGE of Fayette is here, but Fayette COUNTY is a
//   different county.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Wauseon, the seat); villages Archbold, Delta, Fayette, Lyons,
//     Metamora (no site) and Swanton (partly Lucas). Clinton, Swancreek and York
//     townships have their own sites.
//   * Two county courts: Western District (Wauseon) and Eastern District (Swanton).
//   * Shared bodies: Four County ADAMhs Board, Four County Career Center and
//     Northwest State Community College (all in Archbold); Four County Joint Solid
//     Waste District (Defiance); NOCAC and MVPO (Defiance).
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * WMTR 96.1 radio and the Open Door of Delta pantry: both sites fail with a
//     certificate error.
//   * CCNO regional jail (Stryker, Williams County).
//   * 9-1-1 center, land bank, transit: no websites found.

